OL,3,GNEWSATeen setting her sights high with
OL,4,Adream RAF career
OL,5,
OL,6,FSitting in the cockpit of a Typhoon
OL,7,Ffighter jet, the aircraft she one day
OL,8,Fhopes to help keep in the sky, Grace
OL,9,Fallows herself a glimpse into the
OL,10,Ffuture.
OL,12,FThe 16-year-old carefully takes in
OL,13,Fevery detail around her, from the maze
OL,14,Fof switches and screens to the view
OL,15,Fthrough the canopy. Outside, engineers
OL,16,Fand ground crew prepare the aircraft
OL,17,Ffor its trip to Sweden.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
