OL,3,GNEWSATeen setting her sights high with
OL,4,Adream RAF career
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Grace, from Grimsby, it is more
OL,7,Fthan just a rare behind-the-scenes
OL,8,Fexperience. It is a chance to get a
OL,9,Ffull insight into the career she hopes
OL,10,Fone day to pursue.
OL,12,FAs she climbs out of the cockpit and on
OL,13,Fto the wing of the plane, Grace's face
OL,14,Flights up.
